        Note on the license: This ontology is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0). In case of dispute over CC BY 4.0 applicability, or in case considering the ontology as a software or part of it, this ontology is to be considered licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
